ion in endurance exercise.", "MACHEFER G:Machefer G is a researcher who has studied the impact of extreme running competitions on blood antioxidant defense capacity.", "VIITALA P:Viitala P is a researcher who has examined the relationship between vitamin E supplementation, exercise, and lipid peroxidation.", "PALACIOS N:Palacios N is a researcher who has contributed to various studies on nutritional ergogenic aids for athletes.", "CONSTANTINI NW:Constantini NW is a researcher focused on the iron status of highly active adolescents, particularly gymnasts.", "HOUTKOOPER L:Houtkooper L is a researcher who has explored eating disorders and disordered eating in athletes.", "SANBORN CHF:Sanborn ChF is a researcher who has studied disordered eating in female athletes.", "ANA ORTOLÁ BUIGUES:Ana Ortolá Buigues is a doctor and co-author of a study focused on water metabolism in patients receiving artificial nutrition. She has made significant contributions to the field of enteral nutrition through her research and studies.", "LUIS ÁNGEL CUÉLLAR OLMEDO:Luis Ángel Cuéllar Olmedo is a medical professional specializing in the field of nutrition, with a particular focus on parenteral nutrition and access routes for enteral nutrition. He is associated with the Servicio de Endocrinología y Nutrición at Hospital Universitario Río Hortega, where he applies his expertise to improve nutritional care for patients."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}